{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IdleDownloadManager is a tool that monitors your chosen folder for downloads and automatically shuts down your PC once downloads finish. Perfect for downloading large files or games. We save energy, we save time. Never worry about babysitting your downloads again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Download Monitoring</strong>  <br>Automatically tracks file activity in your chosen folder and detects when downloads are ongoing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download completion detection &amp; Auto-Shutdown</strong>   <br>Shuts down, hibernates, or runs a custom command after the download is detected as completed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Shutdown Options</strong>  <br>Choose between shutdown, sleep, restart, or executing your custom scripts and- or commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal Resource Usage</strong>  <br>Runs quietly in the background with a clean, minimalist UI.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect tool for gamers, power users, and anyone who downloads large files or games.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Download Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683280/75501c2c1ed731e45674585848b33a9e61e07752.jpg"},{"name":"Download Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683280/55be849517f5385d2b23f78b6cb160cce6625fcf.jpg"},{"name":"Download Addict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683280/bb964d80ba6ec38792d8e2582c1985bdb89b2ec7.jpg"},{"name":"Download Artisan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683280/40d497487852717600d6db3cdfe2f58e984b4d38.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Fast","path":"https: